    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37707" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξυπηρετ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>assist to the utmost,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1156
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ ἑαυτοῦ παρανομίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					12.23
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				3.123
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς σαῖς χρείαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					13.3.1
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sto.</u>
				339.9
			</span></i>:—later in 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχὰς καὶ λιτουργίας τῇ πατρίδι ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(7).406
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>):—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὕτω πᾶσα περίστασις
				-ηθήσεται</span> every emergency <i>will be provided for,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				35.1
			</span></i>.</div>
